 "notes": "All six planned kinds kept. Tiffany keyrings: eight SKUs regrouped into three archetypes (Return to Tiffany tags, Elsa Peretti motifs, Tiffany 1837). LV Rosalie, LV cardholders and Leatherology passport holder stay as flat models (no retrievable page; louisvuitton.com product pages returned 403 and were not worked around). Left out: Hermès key ring (Carmen) — no page with usable detail retrieved; Ridge money clip as separate archetype (covered as Ridge Wallet option and flat model). No traditions: shelf is brand-led, no artisan tradition specific to it."
